{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And the two angels came to Sodom, etc.</b> He said to them: why have you come? They said to him: ״כי משחיתים אנחנו״ — for they said in their hearts: if we say to Lot, leave this place, and do not reveal the reason to him, he will not listen to us. And because they revealed the secret of the Holy One, blessed be He, He judged them, may His Name be exalted, and they were banished from His presence for 138 years. And even though their intent was for good, angels are punished for a slight matter because of the extra wisdom that is in them, as we find with Metatron: אפקיה ומחיוהו שתין פולסי דנורא, because he knew what was in a person's heart, etc. And the Rabbi R. Judah the Pious said: the reason they lash above with sixty, while a court below lashes with forty lacking one, is because below they punish from age thirteen — they lash forty lacking one, which is three times thirteen. But above they do not punish except from age twenty, and therefore they lash sixty, which is three times twenty."], :book :genesis, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:05:39.051407481Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}